{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "fec9552e-8420-4a17-bf33-809cf62e0817",
		"name": "AI Selekt ATS Integration v1",
		"description": "## ATS Integration Guide\n1. **Authenticate** using the Auth > Login request (captures `authToken`).\n2. **Create Entities** (Companies, Jobs, Candidates) via the `/ats/integration/v1` endpoints.\n3. **Trigger AI Call**:\n   - Run *Trigger AI Call Now* (AI Calls folder) to obtain a `callUUID`.\n   - Call *Simulate Answer Webhook* to fetch the `<Stream>` URL.\n   - Use `node SDLC_Docs/ats_integration_v1_demo.js` (or your client) to stream µ-law audio to the WS endpoint.\n4. **Review Call Outputs**:\n   - Use *Simulate Answer Webhook* + logs to verify transcripts.\n   - Fetch ATS details (*ATS Snapshot & Conversations*) to inspect outcomes.\n5. **Hangup Callback**: invoke the new *Simulate Hangup Webhook* to mimic Plivo's final callback and ensure post-call cleanup is tested as well.\n\nSee the AI Calls folder for detailed steps and helper requests.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "46211675",
		"_collection_link": "https://aiselekt.postman.co/workspace/ffb12d7c-cc8f-4510-9443-71fa8a0df14c/collection/46211675-fec9552e-8420-4a17-bf33-809cf62e0817?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=46211675"
	},
